    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE BEST TREASURE - Dive into Frank's Feline Adventure</strong></h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850920/extras/0a52eac829604a54e2e80d57c4c62cee.avif?t=1745499184\" width=616 height=352 /></span><br><br>Embark on the most unexpected journey with Frank, a renowned adventurer, in &quot;The Best Treasure,&quot; a precision platformer game that blends adventure, mystery, and, of course, a plethora of cats! After being deceived by a cunning feline sorcerer, Frank's brother is transformed into an insect. The only way to reverse the spell? Delve into the depths of the Cat Cavern, a place brimming with dangers but also unimaginable treasures.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850920/extras/652c460e993a560ef54c7830609c8783.poster.avif?t=1745499184\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850920/extras/652c460e993a560ef54c7830609c8783.apng?t=1745499184\" class=\"bb_img\" width=140 height=128 /></picture></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850920/extras/5c3888296435946ccd267eaa1796b82f.poster.avif?t=1745499184\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850920/extras/5c3888296435946ccd267eaa1796b82f.apng?t=1745499184\" class=\"bb_img\" width=204 height=192 /></picture></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>100 Challenging Stages</strong>: Every corner of the Cat Cavern is filled with secrets and dangers. With 100 meticulously designed stages, your skill will be tested at every jump, climb, and dash for survival.<br><br></li><li><strong>Diverse Obstacles</strong>: Brace yourself to face spikes, trampolines, voracious bats, treacherous waters, moving platforms, slippery ice, patrol monsters, and sticky slimes. Each obstacle is a new opportunity to prove your worth.<br><br></li><li><strong>Three Game Modes</strong>: Whether you're a newcomer looking for fun or a veteran in search of extreme challenges, &quot;The Best Treasure&quot; offers three game modes to tailor the experience to your preference.<br><br></li><li><strong>Vertical Exploration</strong>: Take control of Frank and explore the cavern by climbing walls with the agility of a cat. Discover secret passages and collect hidden treasures in every shadowy nook.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850920/extras/b3ce415de39ce7122703ac9a74476a97.poster.avif?t=1745499184\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850920/extras/b3ce415de39ce7122703ac9a74476a97.apng?t=1745499184\" class=\"bb_img\" width=68 height=64 /></picture></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850920/extras/c2acca481cb951ff801be385cb6d0670.poster.avif?t=1745499184\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850920/extras/c2acca481cb951ff801be385cb6d0670.apng?t=1745499184\" class=\"bb_img\" width=64 height=60 /></picture></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850920/extras/8d34409f1c35f6426c7397cecbd674cb.poster.avif?t=1745499184\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850920/extras/8d34409f1c35f6426c7397cecbd674cb.apng?t=1745499184\" class=\"bb_img\" width=68 height=64 /></picture></span><br><br></li><li><strong>Captivating Art</strong>: Immerse yourself in a world where feline themes meet fantasy. With art inspired by caverns and adorable kittens (and a villain that's far from cute), each stage is a work of art awaiting your exploration.<br><br></li><li><strong>Immersive Audio</strong>: With an original soundtrack and unique sound effects, every moment in &quot;The Best Treasure&quot; is enhanced to ensure an auditory experience as captivating as its gameplay.<br><br></li><li><strong>An Engaging Story</strong>: Uncover the true motive behind the feline sorcerer's demands. As Frank's journey unfolds, secrets are revealed that go far beyond a simple treasure hunt.</li></ul><br><strong>Venture, explore, and perhaps, discover the true &quot;best treasure.&quot;</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850920/extras/8a112723e1505fc6a504af59fc1aef94.avif?t=1745499184\" width=616 height=352 /></span>",
